WEBVTT

00:04:27.723 --> 00:04:30.138
Nasema anashangaza kwa sababu ni kweli.

00:04:30.138 --> 00:04:33.203
Ni zaidi ya mzuri.

00:04:33.203 --> 00:04:36.964
Msichana yule ni mimi. (Kicheko)

00:04:36.964 --> 00:04:39.982
Nilipokuwa na miaka 13,

00:04:39.982 --> 00:04:43.396
Niliambiwa, umekua mzima,

00:04:43.396 --> 00:04:46.228
sasa umebalehe,

00:04:46.228 --> 00:04:49.595
inadhaniwa uende kambi la kuanzisha.

00:04:49.595 --> 00:04:52.567
Nilisema, "Nini?

00:04:52.567 --> 00:04:56.549
Siendi kwa yale makambi ya kuanzisha."

00:04:58.349 --> 00:05:01.112
Unajua nini mwanamke yule aliniambia?